t's see: 1462 + 43860. Adding 1462 and 43860. Maybe 1462 + 40000 = 41462, then add 3860 more. 41462 + 3860 = 45322. Wait, no, that can't be right. Let me check again. Wait, 43860 is 43,860. So 1,462 + 43,860. Let's add 1,000 + 43,860 = 44,860. Then add 462 more: 44,860 + 462 = 45,322. Okay, that seems right..\n\nNow add 657,900 to 45,322. 657,900 + 45,322. Break it down: 657,900 + 40,000 = 697,900 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
