o:.\n\n2418 (from ones place)  .\n4030 (from tens place)  .\n241800 (from hundreds place)  .\n\nAdding these together: first sum 2418 + 4030 = 6448. Then add 6448 + 241800. Let's do 6448 + 241,800. 6448 + 200,000 = 206,448. Then add the remaining 41,800? Wait, no. Wait 241,800 is 200,000 + 40,000 + 1,800. Maybe easier to add 6448 + 241,800. 6448 + 241,800. Break down 6448 into 6000 + 448. So 6000 + 241,800 = 247,800 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
