ing those gives 5600+352=5952. Then multiply by 100, so 5952*100=595,200. So the third part is 595,200..\n\nNow I need to add all three parts together: 744 (from ones place) + 29,760 (tens) + 595,200 (hundreds). Let's do this step by step..\n\nFirst, 744 + 29,760. Let's add 744 +29,760. Adding 744 to 29,760: 29,760 +700=30,460; then +44=30,504. So that's 30,504..\n\nNext, add 30,504 to 595,200. 595,200 +30,000=625,200 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
