70. Then 1770 + 88,500. Let's see, 88,500 + 1000 is 89,500. So 88,500 + 1770 = 88,500 + 1700 = 90,200? Wait, no. Wait, 88,500 + 1,000 is 89,500 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
