which is 500. So 196 multiplied by 500. Multiplying by 500 is the same as multiplying by 5 and then by 100. 196 times 5 is 980. Then 980 times 100 is 98,000. So that's 98,000..\n\nNow I need to add all these three results together: 1764 (from ones place) + 17,640 (tens place) + 98,000 (hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. First, 1764 + 17,640. Let's see: 1764 + 17,640. Adding 1764 and 17,640. 1764 + 17,640. Hmm, 17,640 + 1,764. Let's break it down. 17,640 + 1,000 is 18,640. Then add 764 more: 18,640 + 764 = 19,404. So that's 19,404..\n\nThen add 98,000 to that. 19,404 + 98,000. Let's do 19,404 + 98,000. 19,404 + 90,000 is 109,404 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
