nes place).\n- 37,240 (from tens place).\n- 53,200 (from hundreds place).\n\nAdding them step by step. First, add 532 and 37,240. 532 + 37,240. Let me compute that. 37,240 + 500 is 37,740, then +32 is 37,772. .\n\nNext, add 53,200 to that total. 37,772 + 53,200. Let's see, 37,772 + 50,000 is 87,772 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
