ds: 5000 + 19,000 = 24,000. Then 856 + 520 = 1,376. So total here is 24,000 + 1,376 = 25,376. Then add the 195,200. 25,376 + 195,200. That's 200,000 + (25,376 - 4,800) [Wait, maybe easier to add directly]. 25,376 + 195,200. 195,200 + 25,000 = 220,200 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
