Then multiply by 100 to get 58,500. So the third step result is 58,500..\n\nNow I have to add all these results together: 351 (from ones place) + 7020 (from tens) + 58,500 (from hundreds). Let me add them step by step. First, 351 + 7020. Adding 351 and 7000 gives 7351, then add the remaining 20 to get 7371. Then add 58,500 to 7371 So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
